# Touch layer P2 (docs/journal/PLAN.md §3, docs/image/ROOTFS.md "Touch layer P2"): the
# omarchy-mobile packages built from pkg/ by tools/build-pkg, installed by
# rootfs/install-mobile.sh in their own Dockerfile step (after the slow
# package layers). One per line, "name  # why"; every line is mandatory and
# must come from the local [t715-omarchy] repository.
omamobile-omarchy       # Omarchy's touch patches and their applier (pkg/omamobile-omarchy)
omamobile-shell         # the touch shell: bar, quick settings, launcher, recents, home, back swipe (pkg/omamobile-shell)
omatel-agent            # phone and messages service over the ModemManager API: rings, call log, SMS store (pkg/omatel-agent)
omaphone                # Phone app: dialpad, call log, contacts, in-call screen (pkg/omaphone)
omamessages             # Messages app: SMS conversations (pkg/omamessages)
t715-modem              # the SS333 stack: loader, shannond, ModemManager facade, NV provisioning, units (pkg/t715-modem)
t715-chromium           # the default browser: launcher and update tool for Debian's Chromium, in its own root (Dockerfile, step 3b)
t715-camera             # Photo and Selfie: one picture at a time from the two cameras, raw Bayer developed in software; libcamera's software ISP on the CPU
libcamera               # 0.7.2 with omarchy-mobile's software ISP patches and the S5K4H5/S5K6B2 (pkg/libcamera), over ALARM's
libcamera-ipa           # its software ISP IPA and the two cameras' tuning files (pkg/libcamera)
omacam                  # Camera: preview, tap to focus, photos and video on libcamera (pkg/omacam, omarchy-mobile's app)
t715-gps                # Location: gpsd from SYSTEM, offline and on demand, as GeoClue's only source (pkg/t715-gps)
t715-claude-code        # Claude Code's installer, patched for this tablet: no Anthropic binary in the image (pkg/t715-claude-code)
